{"1097410": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Kittens Game", "steam_appid": 1097410, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kittens Game is a village simulation text game. You manage a village of kittens as they acquire resources and unlock new technologies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 30 different buildings, 50+ resources, hundreds of technologies and upgrades. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build a village of kittens and bring them to the moon</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the uncountable game mechanics and progression systems on your way to world domination:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect resources and build structures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage jobs, skills and happiness of your population</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft, trade and research new technologies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock secrets of the Cath planet and reach  the outer space</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And  many more</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Create your pet civilization</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kittens Game is designed to be play over a long period of time, in a semi-idle manner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is your sandbox to enjoy and your personal tamagochi to take care of. Play as actively or hands off as you want, you are the master of your world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kittens Game is a village simulation text game. You manage a village of kittens as they acquire resources and unlock new technologies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 30 different buildings, 50+ resources, hundreds of technologies and upgrades. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build a village of kittens and bring them to the moon</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the uncountable game me